# Advisories govulncheck reports that don't apply here, one per line: ID, then why.
# CI fails on any other advisory whose vulnerable code is reachable. Review this list
# whenever the dependency named below is bumped; remove entries a fix makes unnecessary.
#
# github.com/ollama/ollama: these advisories cover the Ollama server and name the whole
# module, with no fixed version. This module uses only the api client package, to talk to
# a server on the loopback address; it never runs the server, pulls models or handles
# registry tokens.
GO-2025-3557  server: Ollama Allocation of Resources Without Limits or Throttling vulnerability (CVE-2025-0315)
GO-2025-3558  server: Ollama Allows Out-of-Bounds Read (CVE-2024-12055)
GO-2025-3559  server: Ollama Divide By Zero vulnerability (CVE-2025-0317)
GO-2025-3582  server: Ollama Denial of Service (DoS) via Null Pointer Dereference (CVE-2025-0312)
GO-2025-3689  server: Ollama Divide by Zero Vulnerability (CVE-2024-8063)
GO-2025-3695  server: Ollama Server Vulnerable to Denial of Service (DoS) Attack (CVE-2025-1975)
GO-2025-3824  server: Ollama vulnerable to Cross-Domain Token Exposure (CVE-2025-51471)
GO-2025-4251  server: Ollama has missing authentication enabling attackers to perform model management operations (CVE-2025-63389)
